00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:23.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I mean, I moved here --
pbht! -- 40 years ago?

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-He was --

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:26.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
He lived, like, over there
-Yeah.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:29.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
